;. /extract_lessons_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition extract_lessons
  ;= Extract supported lessons from settled work
    This flow returns native values. Use the retain_result writer for a standalone occurrence. Compose project_result when a Nenex document is wanted. Publish the named child flows before publishing this composition; their exact definitions are captured.

    ;@ /flow/input capture
    ;= capture

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= sources

    ;@ /flow/input provider
    ;= provider

    ;@ /flow/step grounded ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/library/task_sources
    ;@ /flow/bind capture capture
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;= grounded

    ;@ /flow/step task ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/lessons
    ;@ /flow/bind pages document
    ;@ /flow/bind sources grounded
    ;@ /flow/bind context capture
    ;= task

    ;@ /flow/step answered ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/interactive_requests
    ;@ /flow/bind tasks task
    ;@ /flow/bind provider provider
    ;= answered

    ;@ /flow/step lessons ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/results
    ;@ /flow/bind responses answered
    ;= lessons

    ;@ /flow/result lessons
    ;= Extract supported lessons from settled work result

    ;@ /flow/page /
    ;= Extract supported lessons from settled work
      Compare the task goal, exact settled work and current instructions. Return observation, interpretation, rule, counterexample and note separately. Ground the observation in the captured work. Do not invent tool actions or successful tests from a summary. A bounded display is not the entire trace. Leave a field empty and explain the evidence gap if no defensible lesson can be extracted. This stage proposes a lesson; it does not adopt it.
